            <div class="main-content">
                <h2>Turn Back the Clock with Botox & Dysport</h2>
                <p>Botox and Dysport are FDA-approved neurotoxin treatments that temporarily relax facial muscles to smooth wrinkles and prevent new lines from forming. At Smart Skin Dermatology, our experienced injectors deliver natural-looking results that refresh your appearance without looking "frozen."</p>
                
                <h3>Treatment Areas</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Forehead Lines</strong> – Horizontal lines across the forehead</li>
                    <li><strong>Frown Lines (11s)</strong> – Vertical lines between the eyebrows</li>
                    <li><strong>Crow's Feet</strong> – Lines around the outer corners of the eyes</li>
                    <li><strong>Brow Lift</strong> – Subtle elevation of the eyebrows</li>
                    <li><strong>Bunny Lines</strong> – Lines on the sides of the nose</li>
                    <li><strong>Lip Lines</strong> – Vertical lines around the mouth</li>
                    <li><strong>Chin Dimpling</strong> – "Orange peel" texture on the chin</li>
                    <li><strong>Neck Bands</strong> – Platysmal bands on the neck</li>
                </ul>
                
                <h3>Botox vs. Dysport</h3>
                <p>Both products work similarly but have slight differences:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Botox</strong> – Most well-known brand, precise control, ideal for targeted areas</li>
                    <li><strong>Dysport</strong> – Spreads more, great for larger areas like the forehead, may work slightly faster</li>
                </ul>
                <p>During your consultation, we'll recommend the best option for your goals.</p>
                
                <h3>What to Expect</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Consultation:</strong> We'll discuss your goals and develop a treatment plan</li>
                    <li><strong>Treatment:</strong> Takes 10-15 minutes with minimal discomfort</li>
                    <li><strong>Results:</strong> Begin appearing in 3-7 days, full effect at 2 weeks</li>
                    <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Results last 3-4 months on average</li>
                    <li><strong>No Downtime:</strong> Return to normal activities immediately</li>
                </ul>
                
                <h3>Medical Uses for Botox</h3>
                <p>Botox isn't just cosmetic – it's also used to treat medical conditions:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Hyperhidrosis</strong> – Excessive sweating of underarms, hands, or feet</li>
                    <li><strong>Chronic Migraines</strong> – FDA-approved for migraine prevention</li>
                    <li><strong>TMJ/Jaw Clenching</strong> – Relieve tension and slim the jawline</li>
                </ul>
                
                <h3>Pricing</h3>
                <p>Botox and Dysport are priced per unit. The number of units needed varies by treatment area and individual. We'll provide a personalized quote during your consultation. Contact us for current pricing.</p>
